出研究，相关事项应按照适用要求处理。","rationale":"已确认项目事实支持本研究为中国多中心III期确证性研究且受试者为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者；监管参考来源支持伦理委员会/机构委员会在安全性、监管或其他原因下要求终止研究或受试者退出的表述。医学作者需核对伦理审查提交文件、跟踪审查时限、知情同意版本管理及伦理委员会沟通流程。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5","section_number":"11.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b0a76ed0cd46607a5feb2920","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922044230_ab81ac64","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"5ac919b18530a35e6df200dbf04b4bc9fbd8d00da2c279aa58a1ff849584b451","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_phase"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_region"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_center"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"适应症：成人中重度斑块状银屑病","quote_sha256":"dea7d22754107be0e06f2a8925034c9cf46e7a270521c79bf1c536d94b1cb3ae","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_population"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，因此，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。","quote_sha256":"a95f171292054da4c0e730a5808f9cf1db173b3e9368862f63a2a3c3172a88c6","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"span_conf_ownership"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时，向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","quote_sha256":"72212ddd536730d0a2974c4030273f17907d9fd3cf58c34a35757517fed79947","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"span_conf_third_party"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_project_phase","span_project_region","span_project_design","span_project_center","span_project_population","span_conf_ownership","span_conf_third_party"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"保密与隐私","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心III期确证性临床研究，研究方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。受试者个人信息和医疗数据应按照知情同意及适用隐私保护要求处理。","rationale":"已确认项目事实支持研究背景；监管参考来源支持方案信息归申办方所有及仅向研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等审阅的保密表述。医学作者需核对受试者个人信息处理、数据披露对象和保存期限等项目细节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_69c81a8357089814","section_number":"11.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:b0a76ed0cd46607a5feb